    "offering_evidence_count": 12,
    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "First, we are aiming to develop next-generation antibody therapeutics addressing limitations of current approved treatments, offering options with a goal to preserve muscle mass, target fat selectively, and provide durable weight loss with improved tolerability.",
        "start_character": 1167,
        "end_character": 1429
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunities will be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer, more effective, have fewer side effects or are less expensive than any products that we or our collaborators may develop based on the use of our technologies.",
        "start_character": 65005,
        "end_character": 65292
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our current therapeutics are all in preclinical development and we have not completed any clinical trials in humans for any therapeutic protein product candidate produced using our technology and there is a risk that we will be unsuccessful in developing or commercializing any product candidates.",
        "start_character": 11870,
        "end_character": 12167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The exercise of these rights may impact our business and ability to provide our products and services.",
        "start_character": 84739,
        "end_character": 84841
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we continue to leverage our technology stack and develop our existing immune-oncology pre-clinical pipeline, we are also seeking strategic partners with the capabilities to more rapidly advance these programs towards the clinic.",
        "start_character": 1936,
        "end_character": 2167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At the core of our platform is an AI-enabled epitope steering engine enabling us to precisely direct antibodies to functional hotspots on even the most challenging targets—often considered \"undruggable.\" When combined with our antibody optimization platform, which deeply integrates generative AI tools with mammalian display technology, we can progress from concept to development-ready antibody in as little as seven months.",
        "start_character": 9404,
        "end_character": 9830
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Building on these insights, we initiated a program to develop a bispecific antibody targeting both myostatin and Activin A.",
        "start_character": 15714,
        "end_character": 15837
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Certain of our development activities involve use of hazardous materials, and we believe we are in compliance with the applicable environmental laws, regulations, permits, and licenses.",
        "start_character": 108732,
        "end_character": 108917
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Discovery, Option and License Agreement: On March 27, 2024, we entered into a collaboration with AstralBio to discover and develop novel antibodies for obesity and other cardiometabolic diseases.",
        "start_character": 42916,
        "end_character": 43111
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Following the NHP pharmacokinetic study, we initiated Chemistry, Manufacturing, and Controls manufacturing and nonclinical toxicology activities to support advancement of IBIO-600 toward clinical development.",
        "start_character": 19204,
        "end_character": 19412
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, we cannot ensure EHS liabilities will not develop in the future.",
        "start_character": 108918,
        "end_character": 108991
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-011888",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-011888-b3d83473eee6700a",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-011888",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In April 2024, as result of the collaboration with AstralBio, we initiated a program to discover and develop a long-acting anti-myostatin antibody.",
        "start_character": 17050,
        "end_character": 17197
      }
    ]
  },
